[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 10261.03, "timestamp": "02:51:01", "text": "任何人都不应该做这件事。你们俩"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10262.79, "timestamp": "02:51:02", "text": "混蛋。是啊，你打算……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10264.55, "timestamp": "02:51:04", "text": "让这位发推的家伙怀孕。进而"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10266.309, "timestamp": "02:51:06", "text": "我会在这里告诉你，我早就告诉过你了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10267.349, "timestamp": "02:51:07", "text": "那么，谁来处理这些问题呢？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10269.19, "timestamp": "02:51:09", "text": "你那些到处乱跑的变异孩子都在这里"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10271.269, "timestamp": "02:51:11", "text": "房子？我。是啊，不过这也没什么关系。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10273.11, "timestamp": "02:51:13", "text": "但怀孕的却是我。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10275.75, "timestamp": "02:51:15", "text": "他的物种并非如此行事。他们得到"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10279.349, "timestamp": "02:51:19", "text": "怀孕很容易。我真是受够了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10281.99, "timestamp": "02:51:21", "text": "拉屎。你看，我只是不想让Twig"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10285.03, "timestamp": "02:51:25", "text": "你觉得我邋遢吗？就这么简单。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10287.59, "timestamp": "02:51:27", "text": "我根本不想让你和他约会。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10289.269, "timestamp": "02:51:29", "text": "我何不把你介绍给我侄子呢？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10292.15, "timestamp": "02:51:32", "text": "格林布尔迪克？他有一份稳定的工作。和"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10294.469, "timestamp": "02:51:34", "text": "是的，在你问之前，他两个都有。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10297.03, "timestamp": "02:51:37", "text": "腿。那不像是家族病史。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10299.59, "timestamp": "02:51:39", "text": "或者任何东西。滚开。成熟点吧。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10302.389, "timestamp": "02:51:42", "text": "习惯我和Twig的存在吧。快点。告诉"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10311.11, "timestamp": "02:51:51", "text": "嗯，我的意思是，确实如此。谢谢。不是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10313.429, "timestamp": "02:51:53", "text": "我需要你的批准。哦，好吧。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10315.19, "timestamp": "02:51:55", "text": "是的。携手对抗抑郁"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10317.03, "timestamp": "02:51:57", "text": "截瘫。我不知道你是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10319.03, "timestamp": "02:51:59", "text": "郁闷。我的意思是，我知道你是"}]